    "en": "I raise ASC control one notch. The particles of the scenery coarsen; the seams of the world show. I search for the frayed edge of the loop, to open an exit outside what he thinks is “himself.”",
    "ja": "私は足元で神楽を一拍。ASC制御を半歩上げる。"
